@switch death_type
@case "lake"
	The edge of the lake ended up being more slippery than you thought.
@case "dragon_approach"
	Your attempt to sneak up on the dragon was ill-conceived. To an astonishing extent.
@case "lava"
	You attempted to swim in the forbidden snack.
@case "lab_ward"
	A lethal-strength anti-dragon ward was placed on the door.
	Perhaps drinking that potion was a mistake.
@case else
	MESSAGE NOT FOUND

@do game_over
